    <title>Vol.15 毕业访谈录 | 学业篇：我很清楚，我是我，别人是别人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6884b361a12f9ff06a216355</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6884b361a12f9ff06a216355</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Jul 2025 10:56:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一场关于考研经验与个人成长的访谈对话。本次会议主要围绕嘉宾小雪的备考北大经历展开，探讨了目标设定、心态管理和学习方法等话题。对话中既分享了考研过程中的具体策略，也深入讨论了个人信念与成功定义等深层思考。</span></p><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 小雪考研北大的动机与目标设定</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 高考与考研的差异性</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 考研学习策略与情绪管理</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> 备考经验及面试分享</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 这次成功意味着什么</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 成功的理解与追求</span></h4><span></span><h4><br></h4>]]></description>
